---
// Главная (страница 1) и архив новостей (/news/page/N/): лента 8 карточек, пагинация, справа вступление и узкая карточка.
import Base from './Base.astro';
import Cards from '../components/Cards.astro';
import Banners from '../components/Banners.astro';
import Pager from '../components/Pager.astro';
import Crumbs from '../components/Crumbs.astro';
import { SITE, PER_PAGE } from '../data/site';
import home from '../content/home/index.json';
import { feed, homeBanners, totalPages } from '../lib/news';
import { route, absUrl } from '../lib/url';
import { graph, website, organization, breadcrumbs } from '../lib/seo';

interface Props { page: number }
const { page } = Astro.props;

const all = await feed();
const total = totalPages(all);
const items = all.slice((page - 1) * PER_PAGE, page * PER_PAGE);
const banners = await homeBanners();
const crumbs = [{ name: 'главная', path: '' }, { name: `страница ${page}` }];

const list = {
  '@type': 'ItemList',
  itemListElement: items.map((n, i) => ({ '@type': 'ListItem', position: (page - 1) * PER_PAGE + i + 1, url: absUrl(route.article(n.id)) })),
};
const title = page === 1 ? SITE.title : `Новости, страница ${page} — ${SITE.name}`;
const description = page === 1 ? SITE.description : `Архив новостей ${SITE.name}: страница ${page} из ${total}.`;
---

<Base title={title} description={description} section="novosti" jsonLd={[graph(website(), organization(), list, ...(page > 1 ? [breadcrumbs(crumbs)] : []))]}>
  <main class="feed" id="content">
    <Cards items={items} />
    <Pager page={page} total={total} />
  </main>

  <aside class="aside" aria-label="О сайте">
    {page === 1 ? (
      <section class="intro">
        <h1>{home.heading}</h1>
        {home.intro.split(/\n\s*\n/).map(p => <p>{p.trim()}</p>)}
      </section>
    ) : (
      <section class="intro">
        <Crumbs items={crumbs} />
        <h1>Все новости — страница {page}</h1>
        <p>Архив новостей {SITE.name}: материалы, вышедшие раньше. Самые свежие — на главной.</p>
      </section>
    )}
    <Banners items={banners} />
  </aside>
</Base>
